<title>FINLAND: FINNISH AUG JOBLESS DATA DUE SEPT 16 0830-MINISTRY.</title>
<headline>FINNISH AUG JOBLESS DATA DUE SEPT 16 0830-MINISTRY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Labour Ministry will release its August employment report on Monday September 16 at 0830 (0530 GMT), the ministry said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The mean of six economists' forecasts for the ministry's August unemployment rate is 17.5 percent in a 17.3-17.9 percent range. In July, the jobless rate calculated by the labour ministry was 18.4 percent.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
